      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JODIE'S ANGEL (7) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (24.57) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Better than last run and makes appeal this time. FINESSE (5) is mixing form lately, finishing out of the placings last time at this track but was a Grade 5 winner two back at Shepparton. Key player on best and worth another try. CHALK AND CHEESE (1) jumped from an awkward draw but scored by 2 lengths (22.80) at Geelong in Grade 5. Has failed to finish in the placings from two starts here. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. CHAPPY'S TOTEM (2) has a solid strike rate at this distance.",
